  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUDHAR- Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUDHAR project is building on EACH project. It is a collaborative programme with Swiss RC and British RC. Under SUDHAR we aim for the following outcomes:
Outcome 01:&#xa0;Strengthened institutional capacity of NRCS and local government to enhance&#xa0;timely&#xa0;decision support systems for disaster and climate-resilient preparedness and response.&#xa0;
Outcome 02:&#xa0;Enhanced multi-hazard preparedness of the health and its critical support systems (WASH, DRR, and community networks) to ensure effective and uninterrupted service delivery in&#xa0;support of the&#xa0;local governments.&#xa0;
Outcome 03:&#xa0;Communities have adopted and practice inclusive health, disaster,&#xa0;and climate-responsive risk-reduction behaviours.</narrative>
  </description>
